 mb-2\">\n              <i data-lucide=\"${isBiogas ? 'flame' : 'paw-print'}\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i>\n              ${roleTitle} Portal\n            </span>\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Circular Waste Routing & Logistics</h1>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-200 text-xs mt-1 max-w-xl\">\n              ${isBiogas \n                ? 'Managing spoiled food, kitchen trimmings, and sour perishables diverted to Biogas anaerobic digesters for clean biomethane electricity.' \n                : 'Rescuing clean plate leftovers, surplus rice, and untouched chapattis for animal shelters, cattle sanctuaries, and farm feed.'}\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Impact Badge -->\n          <div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-4 border border-white/20 text-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 block\">Total Diverted Impact</span>\n            <span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white block mt-1\">\n              ${isBiogas ? `${state.analytics.biogas_kg || 0} kg` : `${state.analytics.animal_feed_kg || 0} kg`}\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-[11px] text-emerald-300 font-semibold\">\n              ${isBiogas ? `⚡ ${state.analytics.green_kwh || 0} kWh Green Power` : `🐾 ${state.analytics.animal_meals || 0} Animal Meals`}\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Waste Logging Counter & Active Dispatch Queue -->\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n        <!-- Left: Waste Logging Form -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center\">\n              <i data-lucide=\"scale\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">Log & Segregate Food Waste</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Direct leftovers into Animal Feed or Biogas stream.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <form id=\"logWasteForm\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1\">Source Facility:</label>\n              <input \n                type=\"text\" \n                id=\"wasteSourceName\" \n                value=\"Hostel Block A Mess Dining Hall\" \n                required \n                class=\"w-full p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800\"\n              />\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 mb-2\">Segregation Classification:</label>\n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5\">\n                <label class=\"p-3 border-2 border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50/50 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer\">\n                  <input type=\"radio\" name=\"wasteType\" value=\"animal_feed\" checked class=\"text-emerald-600\" />\n                  <div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-900 block\">🐾 Plate Leftover Scrap -> Animal Feed</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500\">Clean, edible leftover rice, chappatis, bread suitable for cattle/dogs.</span>\n                  </div>\n                </label>\n\n                <label class=\"p-3 border-2 border-amber-500 bg-amber-50/50 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer\">\n                  <input type=\"radio\" name=\"wasteType\" value=\"biogas\" class=\"text-amber-600\" />\n                  <div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-900 block\">⚡ Spoiled / Unusable Waste -> Biogas Plant</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500\">Greasy kitchen slurry, spoiled dairy, sour dal, rotten vegetables.</span>\n                  </div>\n                </label>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1\">Measured Weight (kg):</label>\n              <input \n                type=\"number\" \n                step=\"0.5\" \n                min=\"0.5\" \n                id=\"wasteWeightKg\" \n                value=\"15.0\" \n                required \n                class=\"w-full p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\"\n              />\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1\">Notes / Condition:</label>\n              <input \n                type=\"text\" \n                id=\"wasteNotes\" \n                placeholder=\"e.g. Untouched boiled rice and dry bread\" \n                class=\"w-full p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs text-slate-800\"\n              />\n            </div>\n\n            <button \n              type=\"submit\" \n              class=\"w-full py-3.5 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow-md transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"\n            >\n              <i data-lucide=\"send\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n              Log Waste & Dispatch Notification to Officials\n            </button>\n          </form>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right 2 Cols: Active Pickup Logistics Queue -->\n        <div class=\"lg:col-span-2 bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">Official Pickup & Logistics Tracking</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Live feed of dispatches sent to biogas and animal shelter teams.</p>\n            </div>\n            <button id=\"refreshWasteBtn\" class=\"p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-600\">\n              <i data-lucide=\"refresh-cw\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n            ${wasteList.length > 0 ? wasteList.map(w => `\n              <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xs transition\">\n                <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold ${\n                      w.waste_type === 'biogas' ? 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800' : 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800'\n                    }\">\n                      ${w.waste_type === 'biogas' ? '⚡ BIOGAS' : '🐾 ANIMAL FEED'}\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\">${w.weight_kg} kg</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">• ${w.source_name}</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600\">${w.notes || 'No extra notes'}</p>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 block\">Logged by ${w.logged_by} at ${new Date(w.logged_at).toLocaleTimeString()}</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                  <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold ${\n                    w.status === 'collected' ? 'bg-green-100 text-green-700' : w.status === 'dispatched' ? 'bg-sky-100 text-sky-700' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-700'\n                  }\">\n                    ${w.status.replace('_', ' ').toUpperCase()}\n                  </span>\n\n                  ${w.status === 'pending_pickup' ? `\n                    <button \n                      class=\"update-waste-status-btn px-3 py-1.5 bg-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-700 text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition shadow-xs\"\n                      data-waste-id=\"${w.id}\"\n                      data-next-status=\"dispatched\"\n                    >\n                      Dispatch Truck\n                    </button>\n                  ` : w.status === 'dispatched' ? `\n                    <button \n                      class=\"update-waste-status-btn px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition shadow-xs\"\n                      data-waste-id=\"${w.id}\"\n                      data-next-status=\"collected\"\n                    >\n                      Confirm Collected\n                    </button>\n                  ` : `\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-emerald-600 font-bold flex items-center gap-1\">\n                      <i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i>\n                      Diverted\n                    </span>\n                  `}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            `).join('') : `\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 py-8 text-center\">No waste dispatches logged yet.</p>\n            `}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\n// ----------------- NOTIFICATIONS MODAL -----------------\n\nfunction renderNotificationsModal() {\n  const notifs = state.notifications || [];\n\n  return `\n    <div id=\"notifsModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 space-y-4 max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"bell\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600\"></i>\n            <h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base\">Alerts & Official Notifications</h3>\n          </div>\n          <button id=\"closeNotifsBtn\" class=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"x\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"overflow-y-auto space-y-3 flex-1 pr-1\">\n          ${notifs.length > 0 ? notifs.map(n => `\n            <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-2xl border ${n.read_status ? 'bg-slate-50 border-slate-200' : 'bg-amber-50/60 border-amber-200'} space-y-1\">\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                <span class=\"font-bold text-xs ${n.category === 'fine_alert' ? 'text-rose-700' : n.category === 'biogas_alert' ? 'text-amber-800' : 'text-slate-800'}\">\n                  ${n.title}\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\">${new Date(n.created_at).toLocaleTimeString([], {hour: '2-digit', minute:'2-digit'})}</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600\">${n.message}</p>\n              ${!n.read_status ? `\n                <button class=\"mark-read-btn text-[10px] text-emerald-700 font-bold hover:underline\" data-notif-id=\"${n.id}\">\n                  Mark as read\n                </button>\n              ` : ''}\n            </div>\n          `).join('') : `\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 py-8 text-center\">No notifications at this time.</p>\n          `}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\n// ----------------- INTERACTIVE EVENT LISTENERS -----------------\n\nfunction attachEventListeners() {\n  // Initialize Lucide Icons\n  if (window.lucide) {\n    window.lucide.createIcons();\n  }\n\n  // 1. Role Switchers\n  document.querySelectorAll('.role-switch-btn').forEach(btn => {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n      const targetRole = btn.dataset.role;\n      state.setRole(targetRole);\n    });\n  });\n\n  const mobileSelector = document.getElementById('mobileRoleSelector');\n  if (mobileSelector) {\n    mobileSelector.addEventListener('change', (e) => {\n      state.setRole(e.target.value);\n    });\n  }\n\n  // 2. User Persona Selector\n  const userSelector = document.getElementById('userSelector');\n  if (userSelector) {\n    userSelector.addEventListener('change', (e) => {\n      state.setRole(state.currentRole, e.target.value);\n    });\n  }\n\n  // 3. Notifications Modal\n  const openNotifsBtn = document.getElementById('openNotifsBtn');\n  const closeNotifsBtn = document.getElementById('closeNotifsBtn');\n  const notifsModal = document.getElementById('notifsModal');\n\n  if (openNotifsBtn && notifsModal) {\n    openNotifsBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      notifsModal.classList.remove('hidden');\n    });\n  }\n  if (closeNotifsBtn && notifsModal) {\n    closeNotifsBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      notifsModal.classList.add('hidden');\n    });\n  }\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('.mark-read-btn').forEach(btn => {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      await api.markNotificationRead(btn.dataset.notifId);\n      await state.refreshNotifications();\n    });\n  });\n\n  // 4. Hosteller Meal RSVP Actions\n  const btnAttendYes = document.getElementById('btnAttendYes');\n  const btnAttendNo = document.getElementById('btnAttendNo');\n  const dietarySection = document.getElementById('dietarySection');\n  const quantitySection = document.getElementById('quantitySection');\n\n  let attendingState = true;\n  let dietaryState = 'Veg';\n\n  if (btnAttendYes && btnAttendNo) {\n    btnAttendYes.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      attendingState = true;\n      btnAttendYes.classList.add('border-emerald-600', 'bg-emerald-50', 'text-emerald-900', 'font-bold');\n      btnAttendNo.classList.remove('border-rose-500', 'bg-rose-50', 'text-rose-900', 'font-bold');\n      dietarySection?.classList.remove('hidden');\n      quantitySection?.classList.remove('hidden');\n    });\n\n    btnAttendNo.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      attendingState = false;\n      btnAttendNo.classList.add('border-rose-500', 'bg-rose-50', 'text-rose-900', 'font-bold');\n      btnAttendYes.classList.remove('border-emerald-600', 'bg-emerald-50', 'text-emerald-900', 'font-bold');\n      dietarySection?.classList.add('hidden');\n      quantitySection?.classList.add('hidden');\n    });\n  }\n\n  const btnSelectVeg = document.getElementById('btnSelectVeg');\n  const btnSelectNonVeg = document.getElementById('btnSelectNonVeg');\n\n  if (btnSelectVeg && btnSelectNonVeg) {\n    btnSelectVeg.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      dietaryState = 'Veg';\n      btnSelectVeg.classList.add('border-green-600', 'bg-green-50', 'text-green-900', 'font-bold');\n      btnSelectNonVeg.classList.remove('border-red-600', 'bg-red-50', 'text-red-900', 'font-bold');\n      // Re-render quantities for Veg\n      state.notify();\n    });\n\n    btnSelectNonVeg.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      dietaryState = 'Non-Veg';\n      btnSelectNonVeg.classList.add('border-red-600', 'bg-red-50', 'text-red-900', 'font-bold');\n      btnSelectVeg.classList.remove('border-green-600', 'bg-green-50', 'text-green-900', 'font-bold');\n      // Re-render quantities for Non-Veg\n      state.notify();\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Quantity Stepper buttons (+ and -)\n  document.querySelectorAll('.qty-increment').forEach(btn => {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const itemName = btn.dataset.item;\n      const max = parseInt(btn.dataset.max || '10', 10);\n      const spanId = `qty_${itemName.replace(/\\s+/g, '_')}`;\n      const span = document.getElementById(spanId);\n      if (span) {\n        let current = parseInt(span.innerText.trim(), 10) || 0;\n        if (current < max) {\n          span.innerText = current + 1;\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  });\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('.qty-decrement').forEach(btn => {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const itemName = btn.dataset.item;\n      const min = parseInt(btn.dataset.min || '0', 10);\n      const spanId = `qty_${itemName.replace(/\\s+/g, '_')}`;\n      const span = document.getElementById(spanId);\n      if (span) {\n        let current = parseInt(span.innerText.trim(), 10) || 0;\n        if (current > min) {\n          span.innerText = current - 1;\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  });\n\n  // Save Reservation Submission\n  const saveReservationBtn = document.getElementById('saveReservationBtn');\n  if (saveReservationBtn) {\n    saveReservationBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      saveReservationBtn.disabled = true;\n      saveReservationBtn.innerHTML = 'Submitting...';\n\n      // Gather item quantities\n      const quantities = {};\n      document.querySelectorAll('.item-qty-val').forEach(span => {\n        const key = span.id.replace('qty_', '').replace(/_/g, ' ');\n        quantities[key] = parseInt(span.innerText.trim(), 10) || 0;\n      });\n\n      const payload = {\n        meal_id: state.selectedMealId,\n        user_id: state.currentUser.id,\n        attending: attendingState,\n        dietary_choice: attendingState ? dietaryState : null,\n        quantities: attendingState ? quantities : {}\n      };\n\n      try {\n        await api.submitReservation(payload);\n        await state.refreshCurrentUser();\n        await state.refreshChefDemand();\n        alert('✅ Your meal RSVP and portion plan were registered successfully!');\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('Error saving reservation: ' + err.message);\n      } finally {\n        saveReservationBtn.disabled = false;\n        saveReservationBtn.innerHTML = 'Confirm Selection & Update Canteen Entry Pass';\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Pay Fine\n  const payFineBtn = document.getElementById('payFineBtn');\n  if (payFineBtn) {\n    payFineBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      const userId = payFineBtn.dataset.userId;\n      const amount = parseFloat(payFineBtn.dataset.amount) || 100;\n      if (confirm(`Confirm payment of ₹${amount} to clear Black Stars and penalty fine?`)) {\n        await api.payFine(userId, amount);\n        await state.refreshCurrentUser();\n        await state.refreshUsers();\n        alert('🎉 Fine cleared! Your Black Stars have been reset to 0.');\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Meal selector change\n  const mealSelector = document.getElementById('mealSelector') || document.getElementById('chefMealSelector') || document.getElementById('gatekeeperMealSelector');\n  if (mealSelector) {\n    mealSelector.addEventListener('change', (e) => {\n      state.selectMeal(e.target.value);\n    });\n  }\n\n  // 5. Gatekeeper Scan Verification\n  const btnVerifyEntry = document.getElementById('btnVerifyEntry');\n  const scanStudentSelect = document.getElementById('scanStudentSelect');\n  const entryResultContainer = document.getElementById('entryResultContainer');\n\n  if (btnVerifyEntry && scanStudentSelect && entryResultContainer) {\n    btnVerifyEntry.addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      const studentId = scanStudentSelect.value;\n      const res = await api.canteenEntry(state.selectedMealId, studentId);\n      entryResultContainer.classList.remove('hidden');\n\n      if (res.success) {\n        entryResultContainer.className = 'p-4 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-900';\n        entryResultContainer.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-emerald-800\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"check-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n            APPROVED: ${res.user.name} checked in!\n          </div>\n          <p>Dietary Choice: <b>${res.dietary_choice}</b></p>\n          <p>Portion Allowance: ${JSON.stringify(res.quantities)}</p>\n        `;\n      } else {\n        entryResultContainer.className = 'p-4 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1 bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 text-rose-900';\n        entryResultContainer.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-rose-800\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"alert-octagon\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n            ALERT: ${res.message}\n          </div>\n        `;\n      }\n      if (window.lucide) window.lucide.createIcons();\n      await state.refreshChefDemand();\n    });\n  }\n\n  // 6. Issue Strike / Black Star Penalty\n  const btnIssueStrike = document.getElementById('btnIssueStrike');\n  const strikeStudentSelect = document.getElementById('strikeStudentSelect');\n  const strikeReasonSelect = document.getElementById('strikeReasonSelect');\n  const strikeResultContainer = document.getElementById('strikeResultContainer');\n\n  if (btnIssueStrike && strikeStudentSelect && strikeReasonSelect) {\n    btnIssueStrike.addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      const studentId = strikeStudentSelect.value;\n      const reason = strikeReasonSelect.value;\n      const result = await api.issueBlackStar(studentId, state.selectedMealId, reason, 1);\n\n      if (strikeResultContainer) {\n        strikeResultContainer.classList.remove('hidden');\n        if (result.fine_triggered) {\n          strikeResultContainer.className = 'p-4 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1 bg-rose-100 border border-rose-300 text-rose-900 font-bold';\n          strikeResultContainer.innerHTML = `\n            🚨 3 BLACK STARS REACHED! Penalty Fine of ₹${result.fine_amount} has been charged to this student!\n          `;\n        } else {\n          strikeResultContainer.className = 'p-4 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900';\n          strikeResultContainer.innerHTML = `\n            ⚠️ Strike Issued. Student now has ${result.black_stars} / 3 Black Stars.\n          `;\n        }\n      }\n      await state.refreshUsers();\n      await state.refreshCurrentUser();\n      await state.refreshNotifications();\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Quick Strike buttons in audit table\n  document.querySelectorAll('.quick-strike-btn').forEach(btn => {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      const userId = btn.dataset.userId;\n      const res = await api.issueBlackStar(userId, state.selectedMealId, 'Excessive plate food waste flagged by supervisor', 1);\n      alert(res.fine_triggered ? `🚨 3rd Black Star! Fine of ₹${res.fine_amount} levied.` : `⭐ Black Star awarded. Total: ${res.black_stars}`);\n      await state.refreshUsers();\n    });\n  });\n\n  // 7. Waste Logging Form\n  const logWasteForm = document.getElementById('logWasteForm');\n  if (logWasteForm) {\n    logWasteForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const sourceName = document.getElementById('wasteSourceName').value;\n      const wasteType = document.querySelector('input[name=\"wasteType\"]:checked').value;\n      const weightKg = parseFloat(document.getElementById('wasteWeightKg').value);\n      const notes = document.getElementById('wasteNotes').value;\n\n      const payload = {\n        source_partition: state.currentRole === 'event_manager' ? 'event' : 'hostel',\n        source_name: sourceName,\n        waste_type: wasteType,\n        weight_kg: weightKg,\n        notes: notes,\n        logged_by: state.currentUser?.name || 'Staff'\n      };\n\n      await api.logWaste(payload);\n      alert(wasteType === 'biogas' ? '🚨 Spoiled waste logged! Urgent alert sent to Biogas Management.' : '🐾 Plate leftovers logged! Alert dispatched to Animal Feed Partner.');\n      await state.refreshWasteLogs();\n      await state.refreshAnalytics();\n      await state.refreshNotifications();\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Waste Status Update Buttons\n  document.querySelectorAll('.update-waste-status-btn').forEach(btn => {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      const wasteId = btn.dataset.wasteId;\n      const nextStatus = btn.dataset.nextStatus;\n      await api.updateWasteStatus(wasteId, nextStatus, state.currentUser?.id);\n      await state.refreshWasteLogs();\n      await state.refreshAnalytics();\n    });\n  });\n\n  const refreshWasteBtn = document.getElementById('refreshWasteBtn');\n  if (refreshWasteBtn) {\n    refreshWasteBtn.addEventListener('click', () => state.refreshWasteLogs());\n  }\n}\n\n// Start application when DOM is ready\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initApp);\n","Description":"Frontend application controller with all role views and event handling","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Users\\srira\\OneDrive\\Documents\\feedforward\\frontend\\js\\app.js","toolAction":"Creating app.js","toolSummary":"Create frontend application logic"}}]}
