{"step_index":109,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T11:37:16Z","content":"The **FeedForward** platform has been fully developed, tested, and verified on your system.\n\n### Summary of Completed Deliverables\n\n1. **Hosteller & Consumer Portal**:\n   - **Menu Notifications & Cutoffs**: Displays upcoming meal menus (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, Events) with countdown timers.\n   - **100% Attendance Confirmation**: Direct RSVP (\"Yes, I will eat\" vs \"No, I'm skipping\").\n   - **Dietary Selection**: Pure Vegetarian vs Non-Vegetarian.\n   - **Item-Level Quantity Customizer**: Custom portions for items such as Idlis, Chapattis, and Rice bowls with intuitive stepper controls.\n   - **Digital Canteen Entry Pass**: Dynamic QR-style pass displaying meal allowances and check-in status.\n\n2. **Gamified Black Star Penalty & Fine System**:\n   - **Strike Meter**: Visual 3-star meter tracking strikes for unexcused no-shows or excessive plate food waste.\n   - **Automated Fine on 3rd Strike**: Reaching 3 Black Stars triggers an automatic **₹100** penalty fine and warning notification.\n   - **Fine Clearance**: One-click fine settlement that resets Black Stars back to 0.\n\n3. **Head Chef & Event Manager Kitchen Dashboard**:\n   - **Predictive Demand Forecasting**: Real-time aggregated headcount, Veg vs Non-Veg totals, and food waste prevented.\n   - **Exact Itemized Cooking Prep Quota**: Informs kitchen staff of the exact piece count to prepare (e.g. 255 Idlis, 180 Chapattis), preventing kitchen surplus.\n\n4. **Canteen Gatekeeper Check-in Desk**:\n   - Verification terminal to scan arriving students against meal RSVPs.\n   - 1-click strike enforcement desk for plate food waste and unexcused no-shows.\n\n5. **Circular Waste Redistribution & Official Dispatches**:\n   - **Waste Segregation**:\n     - *Clean plate scraps* $\\rightarrow$ routed to **Animal Feed** (animal shelters/cattle farms).\n     - *Spoilt & unusable food* $\\rightarrow$ routed to **Biogas Digestion Plants**.\n   - **Official Alerts**: Instant automated notifications sent to Biogas Management and Animal Feed partners.\n   - **Logistics Lifecycle**: Tracks collection from *Pending Pickup* $\\rightarrow$ *Dispatched* $\\rightarrow$ *Collected*.\n   - **Sustainability Metrics**: Live counters for total food saved, biomethane generated ($\\text{m}^3$), green electricity ($\\text{kWh}$), and animal meals provided.\n\n---\n\n### How to Run\n\n1. Open your terminal in the project directory:\n   ```cmd\n   cd c:\\Users\\srira\\OneDrive\\Documents\\feedforward\n   ```\n2. Launch the server using either:\n   - **Batch launcher**: [run.bat](file:///c:/Users/srira/OneDrive/Documents/feedforward/run.bat)\n   - **PowerShell launcher**: [run.ps1](file:///c:/Users/srira/OneDrive/Documents/feedforward/run.ps1)\n   - Or directly: `python -m uvicorn backend.app:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000 --reload`\n3. Access the application in your browser at:\n   ```\n   http://localhost:8000/\n   ```\n\n### Verification & Automated Testing\nThe automated test suite in [tests/test_backend.py](file:///c:/Users/srira/OneDrive/Documents/feedforward/tests/test_backend.py) verifies every functional requirement:\n```bash\npython tests/test_backend.py\n```\n**Result**: `[SUCCESS] ALL BACKEND TEST CASES PASSED PERFECTLY!`\n\nA detailed report of the changes and test results is available in the [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/srira/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e3ecbfea-6f17-4d46-865f-168fe611b984/walkthrough.md)."}
